  "description": "Superlight, stiff and smooth on the trail the SLM is at the pinnacle of hardtail XC mountain bikes. With a long, low and aggressive geometry the SLM is ready to play at World Cup tracks or your local XC series. Choose between two levels of carbon on the SLM. C15 on the 1 series when you need a superlight World Cup ready frame or our lightweight C10 carbon found in our 2 series models. Oversized frame tubes and hyper-short chainstays create lightweight, stiff and fast frame. Thru-axle drop-outs front and rear enhance steering precision 29\" wheels roll over obstacles and maintain speed over rough terrain better than smaller wheels.",
